{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちぴょんっひなぴょんっ (。　　　)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の記事にコメントありがとうっっ。\n嬉しいよっ♪//"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体調わるくて更新するの遅れました(´;ω;`)。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんね;;"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう、よくなったので大丈夫だよっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/01/13/1046166/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんと飴と鞭コンビで遊んだよんっ♪//"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目的は、ぱんけーきを食べるぞっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/01/13/1046166/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気合いをいれて、早起きしたよっ(´,,・ω・,,`)\nパンケーキとスクランブルエッグを食べたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/01/13/1046166/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もぐ\n美味しいっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/01/13/1046166/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふわふわだよっ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎スクランブルエッグ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/01/13/1046166/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎パンケーキ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/01/13/1046166/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上手に撮れたっ☆彡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっとねかずみんとお喋り!\n盛り上がる♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハロ紺行きたい　とかねっ 　 。・"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったよ　(。・ω・。)*."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんありがとっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それからそれから\nお昼過ぎにお家ついて、お昼寝したよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/01/13/1046166/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/01/13/1046166/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にゅん\n(かずみんもお昼寝したみたいねっ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"充実!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"TOKYO DOME〜1830mの夢〜は、\n何度みても感動するね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、\n１日目からメンバーとみてたんだけど\n今日見終わったよっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何度も、巻き戻したりしつつね☆彡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夢の河と桜の花びらたちは、特に泣ける(´;ω;`)ぐわっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サイリウムがきれいだったな　 .*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生で見たかったな☆彡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"陽菜のブログ読んでくださってる方の中にも\nドームコンサートを見にいったかたいるのかな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"AKB48さん方も見に来ている皆さんも\n本当に本当に楽しそうで*."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"陽菜も\nアイドルさんのライブを見るのも\nライブをするのも\n楽しくて、大好きだから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルさんのライブ行ったりして、\nいいところを吸収していきたいし 　 。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46として\nライブをもっともっとしていきたいなっ\nって思いました(/ω＼*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(´・×・*)｛ ひなぴょんの質問たいむっ☆彡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではなくっ今回は、\nみなさんから陽菜への質問募集しますっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/01/13/1046166/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問があったら、\nこの記事のコメントに書いて下さると\nわかりやすいので嬉しいです+.*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その中から、\n答えれるものを何回かに分けて答えていきますねっ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくねっ♪//"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みーんなの心に魔法をかけちゃうぞ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/01/13/1046166/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいぴょんっ"}],"source":"archive"}